  {"type":"text","text":"气体膨胀时外压沿可逆路径变化，体积功为：","page_idx":0,"bbox":[85,715,915,755]},
  {"type":"equation","text":"w=-\\int_{V_1}^{V_2}p_{\\mathrm{ext}}\\,\\mathrm{d}V=-nRT\\ln\\frac{V_2}{V_1}","text_format":"latex","page_idx":0,"bbox":[85,775,915,855]}
